{"seq":3,"slug":"cell-life-cycle","title":"高三生物 — 细胞生命历程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/molecular-review/cell-life-cycle","wordCount":1962,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三生物-细胞生命历程\">高三生物 — 细胞生命历程</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>细胞的生命历程包括细胞增殖、分化、衰老和凋亡四个主题，其中有丝分裂和减数分裂是高考的重中之重。高三阶段需要准确掌握两种分裂方式中染色体和 DNA 的数量变化规律，并能通过显微图像或曲线图判断细胞所处的分裂时期。</p>\n<p>细胞生命历程的核心事件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>本质</th>\n<th>意义</th>\n<th>高考考查方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有丝分裂</td>\n<td>体细胞增殖</td>\n<td>保持细胞遗传一致性</td>\n<td>各期特征、染色体/DNA 变化曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减数分裂</td>\n<td>生殖细胞形成</td>\n<td>维持物种染色体数目恒定</td>\n<td>与有丝分裂的对比、异常分裂分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细胞分化</td>\n<td>基因的选择性表达</td>\n<td>形成不同类型的细胞</td>\n<td>概念辨析、与全能性的关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细胞衰老</td>\n<td>细胞结构和功能退化</td>\n<td>个体衰老的细胞学基础</td>\n<td>衰老特征的判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细胞凋亡</td>\n<td>基因控制的程序性死亡</td>\n<td>维持内环境稳态</td>\n<td>与细胞坏死的区别</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-有丝分裂\">一、有丝分裂</h3><p><strong>细胞周期</strong>：连续分裂的细胞从一次分裂完成到下一次分裂完成为一个细胞周期。包括分裂间期（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>G</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{G}_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>G</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{G}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和分裂期（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>M</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">M</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p>间期是细胞周期的主体（约占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span>），主要事件是 DNA 复制和蛋白质合成。</p>\n<p><strong>有丝分裂各期的特征</strong>（以二倍体生物 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为例）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>主要事件</th>\n<th>染色体数</th>\n<th>DNA 数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>间期</td>\n<td>DNA 复制（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span> 期）、蛋白质合成</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n \\to 4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前期</td>\n<td>染色质螺旋化为染色体，核膜核仁消失，纺锤体形成</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中期</td>\n<td>染色体排列在赤道板上，形态最清晰</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后期</td>\n<td>着丝点分裂，姐妹染色单体分开，移向两极</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末期</td>\n<td>核膜核仁重现，染色体解旋，细胞质分裂</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>口诀</strong>：前期——膜仁消失显两体（染色体和纺锤体）；中期——形定数晰赤道齐；后期——点裂数增均两极；末期——两消两现重开始。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-减数分裂\">二、减数分裂</h3><p><strong>减数分裂的过程</strong>（以精子形成为例）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>主要事件</th>\n<th>染色体数</th>\n<th>DNA 数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>减数第一次分裂前期</td>\n<td>同源染色体联会形成四分体，交叉互换</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减数第一次分裂中期</td>\n<td>四分体排列在赤道板两侧</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减数第一次分裂后期</td>\n<td>同源染色体分离，非同源染色体自由组合</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减数第一次分裂末期</td>\n<td>形成两个次级精母细胞</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减数第二次分裂后期</td>\n<td>着丝点分裂，姐妹染色单体分开</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（短暂）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减数第二次分裂末期</td>\n<td>形成四个精细胞</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>减数分裂 vs 有丝分裂的关键区别</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>有丝分裂</th>\n<th>减数分裂</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分裂次数</td>\n<td>1 次</td>\n<td>2 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同源染色体联会</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（减 I 前期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同源染色体分离</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（减 I 后期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子细胞染色体数</td>\n<td>与母细胞相同</td>\n<td>是母细胞的一半</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子细胞遗传组成</td>\n<td>与母细胞相同</td>\n<td>各不相同（基因重组）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-精子与卵细胞的形成过程对比\">三、精子与卵细胞的形成过程对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>精子形成</th>\n<th>卵细胞形成</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起始细胞</td>\n<td>精原细胞</td>\n<td>卵原细胞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减 I</td>\n<td>1 个初级精母细胞→2 个次级精母细胞</td>\n<td>1 个初级卵母细胞→1 个次级卵母细胞 + 1 个第一极体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减 II</td>\n<td>2 个次级精母细胞→4 个精细胞</td>\n<td>次级卵母细胞→1 个卵细胞 + 1 个第二极体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终产物</td>\n<td>4 个精子（需变形）</td>\n<td>1 个卵细胞 + 3 个极体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细胞质分配</td>\n<td>均等分裂</td>\n<td>不均等分裂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-染色体和-dna-变化曲线\">四、染色体和 DNA 变化曲线</h3><p><strong>染色体数目变化曲线</strong>（有丝分裂）：间期和前期中期保持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，后期加倍为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（着丝点分裂），末期恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>DNA 数目变化曲线</strong>（有丝分裂）：间期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span> 期逐渐从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，前期到后期保持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，末期降回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>减数分裂中的变化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>减 I 后期：同源染色体分离，染色体数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n \\to n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，DNA <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n \\to 2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>减 II 后期：着丝点分裂，染色体短暂加倍后恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，DNA <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n \\to n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>识别分裂图像的方法</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>看有无同源染色体——无则为减 II</li>\n<li>有同源染色体时，看是否联会/分离——有则为减 I</li>\n<li>既有同源染色体又无联会/分离——有丝分裂</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"五-细胞分化与全能性\">五、细胞分化与全能性</h3><p><strong>细胞分化的本质</strong>：基因的选择性表达。所有体细胞都含有相同的基因组，但不同细胞中表达的基因不同。</p>\n<p><strong>细胞全能性</strong>：已分化的细胞仍含有该物种的全套遗传信息，在适当条件下可以发育为完整个体。</p>\n<p>全能性大小排序：受精卵 &gt; 生殖细胞 &gt; 干细胞 &gt; 体细胞</p>\n<p>植物细胞全能性的实例：组织培养（离体的植物细胞在适当培养条件下可以分化出完整植株）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-细胞衰老与凋亡\">六、细胞衰老与凋亡</h3><p><strong>细胞衰老的特征</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>水分减少，细胞萎缩</li>\n<li>酶活性降低，代谢减慢</li>\n<li>色素积累（如脂褐素）</li>\n<li>核增大，染色质收缩，染色加深</li>\n<li>细胞膜通透性改变</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>细胞凋亡 vs 细胞坏死</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>细胞凋亡</th>\n<th>细胞坏死</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原因</td>\n<td>基因控制的程序性死亡</td>\n<td>外界不利因素（缺氧、毒物、损伤）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形态</td>\n<td>细胞缩小，核固缩，形成凋亡小体</td>\n<td>细胞膨胀、破裂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>炎症反应</td>\n<td>通常不引起</td>\n<td>引起炎症反应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>意义</td>\n<td>维持内环境稳态、正常发育</td>\n<td>对机体有害</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某动物体细胞有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 条染色体。画出该动物有丝分裂中期和减数第一次分裂后期的染色体示意图。标注同源染色体和姐妹染色单体。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在减数分裂过程中，基因重组发生在哪两个环节？分别简述其机制。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>观察有丝分裂实验中，看到的细胞大多处于分裂间期，原因是什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某人体细胞含有 46 条染色体。其产生的精子中可能含有多少种不同的染色体组合？（不考虑交叉互换）</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>细胞凋亡的研究获得了 2002 年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖。三位科学家通过对线虫的研究，揭示了凋亡过程中的基因调控网络。细胞凋亡的失调与许多疾病相关：凋亡过多导致退行性疾病（如阿尔茨海默病），凋亡过少导致肿瘤发生。</p>\n<p>端粒学说是解释细胞衰老的重要理论。每次细胞分裂，染色体端粒都会缩短一些。当端粒缩短到一定程度时，细胞就不再分裂并进入衰老状态。2009 年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖授予了发现端粒和端粒酶功能的三位科学家。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>细胞生命历程的复习以有丝分裂和减数分裂为核心。有丝分裂保证遗传一致性，减数分裂实现染色体数目减半和基因重组。掌握各时期的染色体行为和 DNA 数目变化是解题的基础，能够识别显微图像和变化曲线是关键能力。细胞分化的本质是基因的选择性表达，全能性的理解与之互补。细胞凋亡与细胞坏死的本质区别在于是否受基因控制。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三生物 — 细胞生命历程","id":"高三生物-细胞生命历程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、有丝分裂","id":"一-有丝分裂"},{"level":3,"text":"二、减数分裂","id":"二-减数分裂"},{"level":3,"text":"三、精子与卵细胞的形成过程对比","id":"三-精子与卵细胞的形成过程对比"},{"level":3,"text":"四、染色体和 DNA 变化曲线","id":"四-染色体和-dna-变化曲线"},{"level":3,"text":"五、细胞分化与全能性","id":"五-细胞分化与全能性"},{"level":3,"text":"六、细胞衰老与凋亡","id":"六-细胞衰老与凋亡"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三生物 — 代谢综合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/molecular-review/metabolism-review"},"next":{"title":"高三生物 — 遗传定律","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/genetics-review/genetic-laws"}}